    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5353ed1e32575f5eb51e7f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久没录辛奇播报了，聊了聊最近很热的世界杯和股票，以及一些杂七杂八的其它消息。大家的夏天还好吗？台风区的亲故们，注意出行安全呀。本期涉及的新闻和资讯如有错漏，欢迎在评论区指正。</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期播报内容】</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 美加墨世界杯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> 韩国人全民炒股</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1078">17:58</a> 爱宝又生新宝宝啦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a> 郑敬淏崔秀英恋爱长跑14年分手告终</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> 南宫珉与陈雅凜即将迎来爱情结晶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 夏日男团女团回归</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a> 金秀贤计划复出</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">32:36</a> 最近看的影视剧和综艺分享</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期插曲】</span></strong><br><span>《Swim》by BTS</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong><br><span>金金、乔比</span></p>]]></description>
