    <guid isPermaLink="false">692ec1984ef12f9fe98232d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Dec 2025 14:30:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是辛奇播报的第五期。这一期我们聊了聊十一月发生的大小事，包含社会、娱乐和影视综领域。时间过得好快，感觉上一次聊青龙奖就在昨天。本期涉及的新闻如有错漏，欢迎在评论区指正。天冷了，亲故们注意防寒保暖。冬天快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期播报内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 韩国总统府启动迁回青瓦台</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 首尔冬季庆典即将开幕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> BBQ 炸鸡入驻北京</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 第 46 届韩国青龙电影奖</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="479">07:59</a> 聊聊《无可奈何》（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 含剧透）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 玄彬和《哈尔滨》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> 其它获奖作品</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 年底颁奖礼扎堆了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> NewJeans 回归 Ador</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 申敏儿金宇彬官宣结婚</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a> 李顺载爷爷去世</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a> 其它零碎娱乐八卦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> 又被 melo 剧伤害了《宇宙嫁给我》《许愿吧，精灵》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2403">40:03</a> 还好有《亲爱的 X》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a>《三傻游肯尼亚》开播，《黑白大厨》即将开播</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">44:03</a> 浅看了两集《换乘恋爱4》和《姐姐对我来说是女人》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期插曲】</span><br><span>《一吻爆炸》OST《Love》is by Sondia</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span><br><span>金金、乔比</span></p>]]></description>
