pan><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1989">33:09</a> 韩剧韩综里的小吃场景</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">38:16</a> 国内的小吃种类</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2991">49:51</a> 简单聊下其它国外的小吃</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span><br><span>金金、乔比</span></p>]]></description>
